Package: asusctl
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ASUS Linux laptop control daemon and CLI
 asusd is a system daemon that provides a safe D-Bus interface
 to control fan speeds, keyboard LEDs, performance profiles,
 battery charge limits, and GPU modes on ASUS laptops.
 .
 Includes the asusctl CLI and the asusd and asusd-user daemons.

Package: rog-control-center
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, asusctl (= ${binary:Version})
Suggests: supergfxctl
Description: GUI for asusctl - ASUS laptop control center
 ROG Control Center is a graphical interface for managing
 ASUS laptop features through the asusd daemon.
 .
 Provides controls for fan curves, keyboard LEDs, AniMe Matrix,
 performance profiles, GPU mode switching, and power management.
